<title>FRANCE: One ship loading wheat at Rouen, one due.</title>
<headline>One ship loading wheat at Rouen, one due.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>One ship was loading 15,000 tonnes of wheat at Rouen, French port officials said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The wheat is for export to Morocco, they said.</p>
<p>One more ship was expected in port by May 21 to load 26,000 tonnes of wheat. The destination was not specified. One vessel is due in port by May 21 to load 25,000 tonnes of barley.</p>
<p>---- Paris newsroom +33 1 4221 5432</p>
